files.doc:
Four fixed-budget MVP continuations with frozen tau/A and bounded W.

Uses the original v5 training bundle. Preserves the old gate as a diagnostic;
MVP admission is the explicitly agreed, separately versioned criterion.

symbols.doc:
Seeded synthetic flow perturbation for exploration experiments, not a
learned exploration policy or a Levy-flight model. Distances are in metres;
observations still carry normalized ToF. Only the added noise is filtered.
